### MEDUSA API — Competition team registration
### Run with VS Code REST Client. Use a team member account and an existing public competition.
### Registration must be open; the team must belong to the competition's organization.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000/api/v1
@memberEmail = participant@example.com
@password = replace-with-participant-password
@competitionId = 1
@teamId = 1

### 1. Login as a team member
# @name memberLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

username={{memberEmail}}&password={{password}}

### 2. Register team for competition (expected 201)
# @name registerTeam
POST {{baseUrl}}/competitions/{{competitionId}}/registrations
Authorization: Bearer {{memberLogin.response.body.$.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "team_id": {{teamId}}
}

### 3. Register the same team again (expected 409)
POST {{baseUrl}}/competitions/{{competitionId}}/registrations
Authorization: Bearer {{memberLogin.response.body.$.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "team_id": {{teamId}}
}

### 4. Try registration without authentication (expected 401)
POST {{baseUrl}}/competitions/{{competitionId}}/registrations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "team_id": {{teamId}}
}

### 5. Try a missing competition (expected 404)
POST {{baseUrl}}/competitions/999999/registrations
Authorization: Bearer {{memberLogin.response.body.$.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "team_id": {{teamId}}
}

### Note
### Use a separate competition/team or remove the first registration to test other scenarios:
### - registration not opened yet or already closed: expected 409
### - private/draft competition: expected 404
### - team from another organization or caller not in team: expected 403


### 6. List registrations (organizer/admin token required; expected 200)
# @name registrationRoster
GET {{baseUrl}}/competitions/{{competitionId}}/registrations?limit=50&offset=0
Authorization: Bearer {{organizerToken}}

### 7. Withdraw registration (team captain token required; expected 204 while competition is published)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/competitions/{{competitionId}}/registrations/{{teamId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{memberLogin.response.body.$.access_token}}

### Note
### Use the current captain's token for withdrawal. A regular team member receives 403.
### Withdrawal is rejected with 409 if the competition is active/completed/archived or registration has closed.
